From: HakiOS
Subject: [PATCH 0129] sweet: render 750x1624 and scale to the 1080x2400 panel

The only option whose p95 crosses 16.7 ms (reports/research-2026-11-06-fps-next.md):
render at the iPhone X's real @2x size, cut the CA attach/blit/clean pixel work
2.25x, and scale the 720x1600 centre of the 750x1624 frame 1.5x to the panel.
Nearest for now; bilinear after 40 ms still if needed.

mkadt.py: display-scale 2, canvas 750x1624 (separate host change). SweetFramebuffer
reports 750x1624, crops 15,12 720x1600, and the band copy maps every destination
pixel to its source; SweetHID maps panel touches through the same crop. The 1:1
1125x2436 path stays with sweetfb_scale=1 (old ADT) or sweetfb_native=1.
